- The amount of people in here

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:04.580
that have a job they
hate and they buy things

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.950
they don't care about to impress people

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.647
they don't give a fuck about
scares the shit out of me.

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:14.905
