of the responsibilities

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.009
and you know we have to
have the stable income,

00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:27.523
we have to do something because
we have to but don't love.

00:00:27.523 --> 00:00:30.978
The question is, what
are the three activities,

00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:34.591
